msgctxt "216"
msgid "Aaaaaagh! I'm so sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Ohh... What an absolute disaster..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"Tell me the truth about these necklaces. These claims you've been making are"
" completely bogus, aren't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"It's just as you suspected. Our Coral Love Necklaces don't\r\n"
"actually possess any sort of power..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"We simply harvest coral from beneath the Okinawan sea and\r\n"
"craft it into necklaces."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Tajima here hasn't really gone through any spiritual\r\n"
"training either. We just slapped some obscure-looking\r\n"
"baubles on him for that \"extra-mystical\" touch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Please... don't send me to the afterlife! I'm begging you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"So basically you're just a couple of scam artists, huh? I should've known."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Please take this. It's the purchase price of your necklace,\r\n"
"along with some money for all the trouble we've caused."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>100.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "336"
msgid "...I hope you can find it in your heart to keep this under wraps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"It may seem like a swindle to you, but this necklace was\r\n"
"originally meant to give people hope and lift their spirits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"We've had so many customers tell us it's given them the\r\n"
"courage to express their feelings of love to someone, or\r\n"
"helped them get through their day at work..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Please don't take that magic away from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Well, it's up to the individual if they want to believe a stupid story about"
" some sponge-type creature scrubbed off the ocean floor. But you need to "
"stop forcing shops to lie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"But if we do that, none of these will sell... and our business would sink to"
" the bottom of the sea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"You said the coral in this necklace is authentic Okinawan coral, right? It's"
" actually a pretty nice piece of work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Of course it is! And Okinawan coral is the best in the world!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"Then focus on the quality of your product. If you sell it\r\n"
"honestly without making false claims, you shouldn't have to\r\n"
"dole out any refunds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Well. So long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Wait!"
msgstr "Aspetta!"

msgctxt "480"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"I wanted to say thank you. You've given me the courage to\r\n"
"try this from a whole new angle... as an honest, everyday\r\n"
"life accessory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Sure. I'll be looking forward to when it hits the shelves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"We've been waiting for you. You're here for the exorcism,\r\n"
"aren't you? It'll cost 50,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "I guess I'd better get rid of whatever's plaguing me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"Very well. We require an offering of 50,000 yen for this\r\n"
"sacred service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Oops... Looks like I'm short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"I see. Well, you can come seek spiritual deliverance from us\r\n"
"at any time... provided you have the means, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"Now, let us begin... I ask you to close your\r\n"
"eyes, and relax your mind..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"Mmmmmmmm... mum... mum... mum...\r\n"
"COME OUT, YOU WICKED, WICKED SPIRIT, YOU!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"You have now been purged of all evil. Wasn't that easy?\r\n"
"Now you should be able to feel the full effects of your\r\n"
"Coral Love Necklace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid ""
"Thank you for your patronage. Feel free to drop by anytime\r\n"
"if you experience any further issues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "(Somehow I don't feel any... less possessed.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Forget it. I'm here to return this necklace for a refund."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid we can't do that in this case. We're happy to\r\n"
"provide refunds for faulty merchandise, but the root of this\r\n"
"problem is clearly an evil spirit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid ""
"Stop giving me the runaround and give me my money instead.\r\n"
"You can have your worthless trinket back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid ""
"My, aren't you persistent...\r\n"
"Gentlemen, it seems we have a \"dissatisfied customer\" on our\r\n"
"hands... I'd appreciate it if you \"showed him to the door\"!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"You interfering with our business, tough guy!?\r\n"
"Well, I suggest you be more appreciative of all the hard\r\n"
"work that went into making this necklace... and get gone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "Not without my money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"Okay... I asked you nicely! Now I'm gonna have to go\r\n"
"hermatypic on your ass... and bury your remains in a reef!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "Sorry. Maybe next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid ""
"I understand completely. You're welcome to come back\r\n"
"at any time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid ""
"So, what is it you wanted to know about our\r\n"
"Coral Love Necklaces?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"I was told this thing would bring me luck with love and\r\n"
"money, but is there any truth to that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid ""
"Of course there is. We've received countless thank-you\r\n"
"letters and emails from all over Japan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid "...Somehow I don't buy that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid ""
"Haven't your finances and romantic opportunities risen drastically since "
"your purchase? If not, then might I suggest holding out a little while "
"longer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid ""
"You see, statistics compiled by our data analysts have shown\r\n"
"that over 99％ of our customers are completely satisfied\r\n"
"with our product."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid ""
"If it is indeed a refund you want, we'll be more than happy\r\n"
"to assist you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid ""
"But before that... I do feel obligated to tell you why you haven't noticed "
"any of its trademark effects."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "Let's hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid ""
"It's very possible that you have an evil spirit corrupting\r\n"
"your natural energies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "Huh? You mean I'm possessed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "Tajima-sensei! Would you kindly come here for a moment?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid "Certainly. What seems to be the matter here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid ""
"Our customer hasn't experienced any of the amazing benefits\r\n"
"our product has to offer. Perhaps you could examine him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid "Ah. Then I shall begin the cleanse immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "Mmmmmmmm... mum... mum... mum..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid ""
"Oh, he's got an evil spirit, all right. Big one, too.\r\n"
"I sensed it bears a deep hatred of the love coral's\r\n"
"unquestionable spiritual properties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid ""
"If you like, Tajima-sensei could rip that evil spirit\r\n"
"right out of you. We're offering this service at a\r\n"
"special price of 50,000 yen today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1200"
msgid "I guess I'd better get rid of whatever's plaguing me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1212"
msgid ""
"Very well. We require an offering of 50,000 yen for this\r\n"
"sacred service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1236"
